    "code": "/// A 2-D vector with component-wise arithmetic.\nstruct Vec2\n{\n    double x, y;\n\n    /// Adds or subtracts component-wise.\n    Vec2 opBinary(string op)(Vec2 rhs) const\n    if (op == \"+\" || op == \"-\")\n        => Vec2(mixin(\"x \" ~ op ~ \" rhs.x\"), mixin(\"y \" ~ op ~ \" rhs.y\"));\n}\n\nauto sum = Vec2(1, 2) + Vec2(3, 4);\n",
